    {
      "source": "By default, no origins are allowed. When\n<a href=\"WebSocketHandlerRegistration.html#setAllowedOriginPatterns(java.lang.String...)\"><code>allowedOriginPatterns</code></a> is also\nset, then that takes precedence over this property.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，不允许任何源。当同时设置`<a href=\"WebSocketHandlerRegistration.html#setAllowedOriginPatterns(java.lang.String...)\"><code>allowedOriginPatterns</code></a>`时，该属性优先于此属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Expose the <code>SockJsServiceRegistration</code> -- if SockJS is enabled or\n<code>null</code> otherwise -- so that it can be configured with a TaskScheduler\nif the application did not provide one. This should be done prior to\ncalling <a href=\"#getMappings()\"><code>getMappings()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "暴露 `<code>SockJsServiceRegistration</code>` —— 如果启用了 SockJS，则暴露该对象；否则为`<code>null</code>`——以便在应用程序未提供时，使用 `TaskScheduler` 对其进行配置。这应在调用 <a href=\"#getMappings()\"><code>getMappings()</code></a> 之前完成。",
      "count": 2
    },
