      "source": "Base class for <a href=\"WebSocketHandlerRegistration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.config.annotation\"><code>WebSocketHandlerRegistrations</code></a> that gathers all the configuration\noptions but allows subclasses to put together the actual HTTP request mappings.",
      "translation": "`WebSocketHandlerRegistrations` 接口的基类，用于收集所有配置选项，但允许子类构建实际的 HTTP 请求映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Alternative to <a href=\"WebSocketHandlerRegistration.html#setAllowedOrigins(java.lang.String...)\"><code>WebSocketHandlerRegistration.setAllowedOrigins(String...)</code></a> that supports more\nflexible patterns for specifying the origins for which cross-origin\nrequests are allowed from a browser.",
      "translation": "替代<a href=\"WebSocketHandlerRegistration.html#setAllowedOrigins(java.lang.String...)\"><code>WebSocketHandlerRegistration.setAllowedOrigins(String...)</code></a>，支持更灵活的指定浏览器允许跨域请求的源的模式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add more handlers that will share the same configuration (interceptors, SockJS\nconfig, etc).",
      "translation": "添加更多将共享相同配置（拦截器、SockJS 配置等）的处理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure interceptors for the handshake request.",
